{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102636","id":2324785259,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6KkWhr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102636","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102636.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102636.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102636","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102636/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102636/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102636/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2ba64a57c5b561e39fd26f1c48465b08c0edf222","number":102636,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix global scripts not being added because of bad `global_script_class_cache.cfg`","user":{"login":"amarsero","id":18059974,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDU5OTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18059974?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero","html_url":"https://github.com/amarsero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amarsero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #102557, probably also fixes #102568\r\n\r\nThe Issue:\r\nA [commit](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/318af42020cd349c5c9c3e4c88aa87249ca224b0) made \"is_tool\" and \"is_abstract\" mandatory to add new global classes to `ScriptServer::global_classes`.  But `global_script_class_cache.cfg` from projects before 4.4 lack these properties, so these classes won't be added, causing errors when running the game.\r\n\r\nCurrent Solution:\r\nAfter the editor scans all the scripts for the first time, now forcibly updates `global_script_class_cache.cfg`, resolving the issue. \r\nHowever, running a 4.3 game with 4.4 without first opening it with the editor at least once still fails.\r\n\r\nI've tried to fix this in `ScriptServer::init_languages`, where the global classes are first loaded, but couldn't figure it out. \r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","number":20,"state":"closed","title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"http